{"id":"07cea5d2f4c7fcf2","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-prf.md","title":"Pseudorandom Function Family","display":"df-prf — Pseudorandom Function Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-prf","aliases":["28-df-prf","Pseudorandom Function Family"],"display":"df-prf — Pseudorandom Function Family","depends_on":["[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","[[28-df-negl]]"],"source_book_location":"Definition 9.16; printed pp.189–190; PDF pp.215–216","source_printed_pages":"189–190","source_pdf_pages":"215–216","source_status":"statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-prf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-prf</span><span>Pseudorandom Function Family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prf — Pseudorandom Function Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 9.16; printed pp.189–190; PDF pp.215–216"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"189–190"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"215–216"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell,m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(\\ell,m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span> 为一元输入上多项式时间可计算且多项式有界的函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a> 意义下的确定型多项式时间两输入函数，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall k\\in\\Sigma^n\\ \\forall x\\in\\Sigma^{\\ell(n)}\\;F(k,x)\\in\\Sigma^{m(n)}\">\\(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall k\\in\\Sigma^n\\ \\forall x\\in\\Sigma^{\\ell(n)}\\;F(k,x)\\in\\Sigma^{m(n)}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_k:\\Sigma^{\\ell(n)}\\to\\Sigma^{m(n)}\">\\(F_k:\\Sigma^{\\ell(n)}\\to\\Sigma^{m(n)}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_k(x)=F(k,x)\">\\(F_k(x)=F(k,x)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_n=(\\Sigma^{m(n)})^{\\Sigma^{\\ell(n)}}\">\\(\\mathcal F_n=(\\Sigma^{m(n)})^{\\Sigma^{\\ell(n)}}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span>、固定元数多输入表示与单比特串/数值的认同见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Negl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Negl}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a>。</li>\n<li>区分器的完整表示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=(q,b,Q,H)\">\\(D=(q,b,Q,H)\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,b\\in\\mathbb N[n]\">\\(q,b\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\)</span> 固定询问次数和随机带长度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,H\\in\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(Q,H\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 分别产生下一询问和最终比特。历史为定长询问/应答块直接拼接所得的比特串，每块长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(n)+m(n)\">\\(\\ell(n)+m(n)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为其空串。单次实验中的函数预言机 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\\in\\mathcal F_n\">\\(O\\in\\mathcal F_n\\)</span> 保持固定。</li>\n<li>下式执行只对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathbf{OPPT}_{\\ell,m}\">\\(D\\in\\mathbf{OPPT}_{\\ell,m}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\\in\\mathcal F_n\">\\(O\\in\\mathcal F_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\Sigma^{b(n)}\">\\(r\\in\\Sigma^{b(n)}\\)</span> 定义；密钥/随机函数的选择与均匀随机带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 独立。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{OPPT}_{\\ell,m}\\coloneqq\\{(q,b,Q,H):\\;&amp;q,b\\in\\mathbb N[n],\\ Q,H\\in\\mathbf{FP},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{b(n)}\\ \\forall t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,q(n)\\}\\ \\forall h\\in\\Sigma^{t(\\ell(n)+m(n))}\\;[|Q(1^n,r,h)|=\\ell(n)\\land H(1^n,r,h)\\in\\{0,1\\}]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{OPPT}_{\\ell,m}\\coloneqq\\{(q,b,Q,H):\\;&amp;q,b\\in\\mathbb N[n],\\ Q,H\\in\\mathbf{FP},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{b(n)}\\ \\forall t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,q(n)\\}\\ \\forall h\\in\\Sigma^{t(\\ell(n)+m(n))}\\;[|Q(1^n,r,h)|=\\ell(n)\\land H(1^n,r,h)\\in\\{0,1\\}]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_0^{D,O,n,r}\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad u_i^{D,O,n,r}\\coloneqq Q(1^n,r,h_{i-1}^{D,O,n,r}),\\qquad h_i^{D,O,n,r}\\coloneqq h_{i-1}^{D,O,n,r}\\,u_i^{D,O,n,r}\\,O(u_i^{D,O,n,r})\\quad(1\\le i\\le q(n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_0^{D,O,n,r}\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad u_i^{D,O,n,r}\\coloneqq Q(1^n,r,h_{i-1}^{D,O,n,r}),\\qquad h_i^{D,O,n,r}\\coloneqq h_{i-1}^{D,O,n,r}\\,u_i^{D,O,n,r}\\,O(u_i^{D,O,n,r})\\quad(1\\le i\\le q(n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D^O(1^n;r)\\coloneqq H(1^n,r,h_{q(n)}^{D,O,n,r}),\\qquad\\operatorname{Acc}_D^O(n)\\coloneqq2^{-b(n)}\\sum_{r\\in\\Sigma^{b(n)}}\\mathbf1[D^O(1^n;r)=1].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D^O(1^n;r)\\coloneqq H(1^n,r,h_{q(n)}^{D,O,n,r}),\\qquad\\operatorname{Acc}_D^O(n)\\coloneqq2^{-b(n)}\\sum_{r\\in\\Sigma^{b(n)}}\\mathbf1[D^O(1^n;r)=1].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adv}^{\\mathrm{prf}}_{D,F;\\ell,m}(n)\\coloneqq\\left|2^{-n}\\sum_{k\\in\\Sigma^n}\\operatorname{Acc}^{F_k}_D(n)-|\\mathcal F_n|^{-1}\\sum_{O\\in\\mathcal F_n}\\operatorname{Acc}^O_D(n)\\right|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Adv}^{\\mathrm{prf}}_{D,F;\\ell,m}(n)\\coloneqq\\left|2^{-n}\\sum_{k\\in\\Sigma^n}\\operatorname{Acc}^{F_k}_D(n)-|\\mathcal F_n|^{-1}\\sum_{O\\in\\mathcal F_n}\\operatorname{Acc}^O_D(n)\\right|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRF}(F;\\ell,m)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall D\\in\\mathbf{OPPT}_{\\ell,m}\\quad\\operatorname{Adv}^{\\mathrm{prf}}_{D,F;\\ell,m}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PRF}(F;\\ell,m)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall D\\in\\mathbf{OPPT}_{\\ell,m}\\quad\\operatorname{Adv}^{\\mathrm{prf}}_{D,F;\\ell,m}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本次把预言机区分器表示展开为多项式次数的自适应调用。每个历史长度至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(n)(\\ell(n)+m(n))\">\\(q(n)(\\ell(n)+m(n))\\)</span>，所以两条固定 FP 函数的全部调用总计仍为多项式时间；提早结束可用无用询问填充。全部随机位长度由区分器元组唯一确定。</p>\n<p>定义 9.16 采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(n)=m(n)=n\">\\(\\ell(n)=m(n)=n\\)</span>，这里把二者显式参数化。预言机在一次实验内保持同一个函数，重复查询得到相同应答；随机带按定义中统一多项式长度均匀抽样。PPT 的普通函数签名不足以表达自适应 oracle 访问，故独立定义 OPPT，而没有把 oracle 输入冒充普通配对输入。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-negl]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\ell,m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$ 为一元输入上多项式时间可计算且多项式有界的函数。$F$ 为 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]] 意义下的确定型多项式时间两输入函数，且 $\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall k\\in\\Sigma^n\\ \\forall x\\in\\Sigma^{\\ell(n)}\\;F(k,x)\\in\\Sigma^{m(n)}$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F_k:\\Sigma^{\\ell(n)}\\to\\Sigma^{m(n)}$，$F_k(x)=F(k,x)$；$\\mathcal F_n=(\\Sigma^{m(n)})^{\\Sigma^{\\ell(n)}}$。$\\mathbf{FP}$、固定元数多输入表示与单比特串/数值的认同见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]；$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F_k:\\Sigma^{\\ell(n)}\\to\\Sigma^{m(n)}$，$F_k(x)=F(k,x)$；$\\mathcal F_n=(\\Sigma^{m(n)})^{\\Sigma^{\\ell(n)}}$。$\\mathbf{FP}$、固定元数多输入表示与单比特串/数值的认同见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]；$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell,m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall k\\in\\Sigma^n\\ \\forall x\\in\\Sigma^{\\ell(n)}\\;F(k,x)\\in\\Sigma^{m(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"F_k:\\Sigma^{\\ell(n)}\\to\\Sigma^{m(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"F_k(x)=F(k,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_n=(\\Sigma^{m(n)})^{\\Sigma^{\\ell(n)}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Negl}","display":false},{"tex":"D=(q,b,Q,H)","display":false},{"tex":"q,b\\in\\mathbb N[n]","display":false},{"tex":"Q,H\\in\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell(n)+m(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"O\\in\\mathcal F_n","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathbf{OPPT}_{\\ell,m}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"O\\in\\mathcal F_n","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\Sigma^{b(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{OPPT}_{\\ell,m}\\coloneqq\\{(q,b,Q,H):\\;&q,b\\in\\mathbb N[n],\\ Q,H\\in\\mathbf{FP},\\\\\n&\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{b(n)}\\ \\forall t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,q(n)\\}\\ \\forall h\\in\\Sigma^{t(\\ell(n)+m(n))}\\;[|Q(1^n,r,h)|=\\ell(n)\\land H(1^n,r,h)\\in\\{0,1\\}]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"h_0^{D,O,n,r}\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad u_i^{D,O,n,r}\\coloneqq Q(1^n,r,h_{i-1}^{D,O,n,r}),\\qquad h_i^{D,O,n,r}\\coloneqq h_{i-1}^{D,O,n,r}\\,u_i^{D,O,n,r}\\,O(u_i^{D,O,n,r})\\quad(1\\le i\\le q(n)).","display":true},{"tex":"D^O(1^n;r)\\coloneqq H(1^n,r,h_{q(n)}^{D,O,n,r}),\\qquad\\operatorname{Acc}_D^O(n)\\coloneqq2^{-b(n)}\\sum_{r\\in\\Sigma^{b(n)}}\\mathbf1[D^O(1^n;r)=1].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Adv}^{\\mathrm{prf}}_{D,F;\\ell,m}(n)\\coloneqq\\left|2^{-n}\\sum_{k\\in\\Sigma^n}\\operatorname{Acc}^{F_k}_D(n)-|\\mathcal F_n|^{-1}\\sum_{O\\in\\mathcal F_n}\\operatorname{Acc}^O_D(n)\\right|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PRF}(F;\\ell,m)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall D\\in\\mathbf{OPPT}_{\\ell,m}\\quad\\operatorname{Adv}^{\\mathrm{prf}}_{D,F;\\ell,m}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.","display":true},{"tex":"q(n)(\\ell(n)+m(n))","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell(n)=m(n)=n","display":false}],"bytes":3339,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"基础安全概念：[[28-df-ppt]]、[[28-df-negl]]、[[28-df-one-way-function]]、[[28-df-hardcore-predicate]]、[[28-df-prg]]、[[28-df-prf]]。"},{"id":"1f166040771c1b1d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$，$d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 满足 $d(0)=1$ 且 $d(n)=2n$ 对 $n\\ge1$，$\\forall s\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|G(s)|=d(|s|)$；$\\operatorname{PRG}(G,d)$ 采用 [[28-df-prg]] 的均匀PPT量词。$\\operatorname{PRF}$ 采用 [[28-df-prf]] 的自适应多项式时间预言机区分器。$m(n)=\\max\\{1,n\\}$；$F:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$。$G_b:\\Sigma^+\\to\\Sigma^+$（$b\\in\\{0,1\\}$）将在下式按切片定义；字串下标从1开始，$\\Sigma^+=\\Sigma^*\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}$。"}],"outgoing":["adb92775ec020a0b","f3171800627deef3"]}